commit_template_hash: 686bd6f6d3f60a9716f8ca85195b61c4852e2e6d8a91cf7a01fc867d6252a9af
intent: Fix agent_env's control-arm PATH filtering: it dropped every PATH directory containing a nool binary to hide it from git-only arms, but claude itself lives in the same ~/.local/bin as nool on this machine -- so every control-arm (git_fleet/git_gated_queue/git_scheduled) agent launch failed with FileNotFoundError: claude, discovered only when actually attempting the claude-sonnet-5 N=10/v3 ladder point (a gap flagged since 2026-08-21, never previously run with this model/corpus combination). Replaced directory-removal with a shim directory (a nool stub that exits 127) prepended onto PATH -- shadows only nool, leaves every co-located tool resolvable. Verified: claude resolves normally, nool resolves to the stub for control arms, nool_ws arms still see the real binary. Landed with this fix: N=10/v3 git_fleet, 2 reps, claude-sonnet-5 (41/60, 39/60 accepted, consistent with the established git conflict pattern at N=20/25/35)
knot_id: 985c6813e207815ad38f948904e1ba77564a8f9e4c7744fcf57473c395a180b2
